1
00:00:44,875 --> 00:00:48,583
Courage, Merry. Courage for our friends.

2
00:00:52,375 --> 00:00:55,667
Form ranks, you maggots! Form ranks!

3
00:00:55,875 --> 00:00:58,875
Pikes in front! Archers behind!

4
00:01:06,792 --> 00:01:11,667
Éomer, take your éored down the left flank.

5
00:01:11,833 --> 00:01:14,792
Gamling, follow the King's
banner down the centre.

6
00:01:14,917 --> 00:01:18,667
Grimbold, take your company right,
after you pass the wall.

7
00:01:18,792 --> 00:01:21,542
Forth, and fear no darkness!

8
00:01:21,667 --> 00:01:25,542
Arise! Arise, Riders of Théoden!

9
00:01:25,667 --> 00:01:28,083
Spears shall be shaken!

10
00:01:28,250 --> 00:01:31,125
Shields shall be splintered!

11
00:01:31,292 --> 00:01:33,000
A sword-day...

12
00:01:33,083 --> 00:01:34,917
...a red day...

13
00:01:35,042 --> 00:01:38,167
...ere the sun rises!
